cat <{echo one} <{echo two}
cmp <{echo a} <{echo a} && echo same
cmp -s <{echo a} <{echo b} || echo differ
. <{echo echo sourced}
x=<{echo assigned}
echo hi | tee >{cat} >/dev/null
wait
fn f { cat $1 }
f <{echo through a function}
echo <{true} | sed 's/[0-9][0-9]*/N/'
echo from-file > g
echo `{cat} <g
